    "windows-gfx1151": {
      "blocked": true,
      "blocked_reason": "Host defect, not a port defect: this host bugchecks HYPERVISOR_ERROR 0x00020001 under any GPU work, traced by dump analysis to csagent.sys (CrowdStrike Falcon), FAILURE_BUCKET_ID 0x20001_28_2_csagent!unknown_function. Six occurrences (4 on 2026-06-03, 2 on 2026-08-14). The port itself is fine on Windows: cmake+ninja build clean at head_sha 3798cb2, scene loads (38386 verts/159870 tets), GLEW inits, renders interactively under Mesa llvmpipe. Both GPU paths crash the host -- hardware GL at ~30s, HIP solver within seconds -- while software GL with the solver stopped survives 46s clean. Needs a working Windows host, or maintainer-approved waiver; do not read this as GPU_IPC being unportable to Windows.",
